        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bite-sized 2D platformer designed for quick sessions and easy fun. Whether you have a few minutes or want to play through in one sitting, Jolly Land Adventure delivers smooth platforming and a lighthearted experience from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; replayable levels</strong><br>Designed for quick runs you can enjoy anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple to learn</strong><br>Responsive controls that feel smooth and precise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful, relaxing world</strong><br>A lighthearted adventure with a cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets to discover</strong><br>Explore levels and find hidden surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for casual play</strong><br>No pressure — just jump in and have fun</p></li></ul>",
